    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84037.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "So let's just get right to it. We saw the numbers today. And we knew the numbers on the unemployment were going to be bad, sir. And and people are really concerned. I'm here in New York. You're a fellow New Yorker. But all across the country, people worried about jobs. What do you want to say to the folks who are just beginning to see that the country is reopening?",
