  {
    "episode_id": 84037,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84037.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Well, it really is. It's starting and it's going to start and I think it's going to get really, and I've been calling it. You actually wrote it once and I do watch you and I think you're terrific, but I have to say, hence, I talk to you. But I think that you're going to see a transition to greatness and the transition is going to begin pretty much now. It's already started. If you look at the stock exchanges when you're 25,000 plus and we just went through the worst pandemic since 1917 over a hundred years. It's pretty amazing. I think you're going to see some very good numbers coming into the third quarter, and I think the fourth quarter is going to be terrific, and I think next year is going to be a great year. We have a lot of stimulus out there. We have a lot of potential to do things, and I just think you're going to see some really good numbers in. I think you're starting to see that right now.",
