    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84037.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "And with the governors that are saying that they're going to need additional funding, they're calling for bailouts, I know that you had a meeting with Governor Cuomo recently. How should that be handled? What's your position on what should go on here with the states that do have big budget shortfalls because of the lockdown?",
